Only the jigsaw half of the mod is ported here. The other input targets are not
wired: upstream's priority-bucketed jigsaw shuffle changes the RNG stream,
26.3 already filters block infos by chunk bounds in `processBlockInfos`, and the
palette rewrite turns the block list read-only. Their supporting code lives in
`org.snowballmc.snowball.structurelayout` for a later patch.

